.3,"_gate_spread":0.09876392989200966,"_gp_spread":true,"_score_spread":49.4,"_gate_roic_consistency":10.093843172524977,"_gp_roic_consistency":false,"_score_roic_consistency":0.0,"_gate_incr_roic":0.02793864303892939,"_gp_incr_roic":false,"_score_incr_roic":26.0,"_gate_margin_advantage":-0.014571814602056254,"_gp_margin_advantage":false,"_score_margin_advantage":28.5,"_gate_pool_share":null,"_gp_pool_share":null,"_score_pool_share":null,"_gate_rev_durability":0.31702279129965616,"_gp_rev_durability":true,"_score_rev_durability":100.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":null,"_gp_fcf_durability":null,"_score_fcf_durability":0.0,"_gate_margins":-0.00910314248993993,"_gp_margins":false,"_score_margins":40.9,"_gate_fund_growth":0,"_gp_fund_growth":false,"_score_fund_growth":0.0,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.03211243551696613,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":true,"_score_shrhldr_yield":46.8,"_gate_share_shrink":13.081583179111096,"_gp_share_shrink":false,"_score_share_shrink":0.0,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.0591269149643773,"_gp_sbc_dilution":false,"_score_sbc_dilution":1.5,"_gate_insider_own":0.00419,"_gp_insider_own":false,"_score_insider_own":2.8,"_gate_insider_buying":0.0,"_gp_insider_buying":false,"_score_insider_buying":0.0,"pf":[],"description_full":"SmartStop Self Storage REIT, Inc. is a self-managed REIT with a fully integrated operations team of more than 1,000 self-storage professionals focused on growing the SmartStop Self Storage brand. SmartStop, through its indirect subsidiary SmartStop REIT Advisors, LLC, also sponsors other self-storage programs, and through its Managed Platform offers third-party management services in the U.S. and Canada. As of September 29, 2026, SmartStop has an owned or managed portfolio of approximately 475 operating properties in 36 U.S. states, the District of Columbia, and Canada, comprising more than 295,000 units and approximately 37.3 million rentable square feet. SmartStop Self Storage REIT, Inc. was established in 2013 and was incorporated in Maryland.","ceo_bio":"Mr. H. Michael Schwartz | Founder, President, CEO & Chairman of the Board | Age 56 | Compensation: $1.0M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Employs approximately 400 people. Revenue per employee of $703K ranks in the bottom quartile among Real Estate peers, with revenue growing 79%/yr across its filed history. Each employee generates $212K of free cash flow annually. Stock-based compensation of $42K per employee reflects an ownership culture. CEO compensation is 1\u00d7 revenue per employee (modest relative to workforce productivity). Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (2/10).","financial_summary":["SmartStop Self Storage REIT, In is a mid-cap real estate business with a $2.3B market cap on $281M of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +10% over the past three years and +32% annually across the full decade, a respectable pace for a business of this size. Operating margins are expanding by +46.0pp year-over-year, which is one of the strongest signals that the moat is deepening.","Returns on capital run at 18% against a 8% cost of capital, a 10-point spread that creates value, though narrow enough that competitive pressure could close it. Gross margins of 64% confirm genuine pricing power.","The business throws off $85M in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 30 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year, and thin 1.0\u00d7 interest coverage leaves no room for a bad year.","Shareholder yield of 3.2% reflects a genuine commitment to returning capital rather than empire-building, and insider ownership is negligible, so management has little personal stake in the long-term outcome."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Piotroski score 3/9 \u2014 the fundamentals are deteriorating on multiple fronts","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (1.3) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Very elevated short interest (18.3% of float) \u2014 sophisticated money is betting against the business","sev":"red","cat":"sentiment"},{"text":"Payout ratio of 267% leaves essentially no coverage if earnings wobble","sev":"red","cat":"dividend"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Trading near 52-week highs \u2014 the market has already recognised the story (confirmed by 2 other valuation measures)","sev":"amber","cat":"valuation","magnitude":0.9762329174093878},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Insiders are overwhelmingly selling (100% sell ratio) \u2014 the people who know the business want less of it","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","ratio":0.0},{"text":"Value-trap profile (score 50/100): durably derated by the market; leveraged balance sheet under pressure \u2014 cheapness may reflect deterioration, not mispricing","sev":"amber","cat":"value_trap"},{"text":"Climate and insurance cost escalation \u2014 rising premiums and coverage withdrawals in flood/fire zones are repricing assets that the market once treated as perpetuities.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Founder-led \u2014 owner alignment that often matters more than any incentive plan","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Real Estate peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood","Among the least levered in Real Estate \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk","Real Estate sector showing strong relative momentum, outperforming the market by 6% over 3 months"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"Can SmartStop Self Storage (NYSE:SMA) Sustain Its Operating Momentum?","source":"kalkinemedia.